%h3 Internationalization
%p
  We've worked with many families that are not native English speakers and
  we want to make Pick-a-Pic accessible to them as soon as we can. 
  Additional language support will be added as time and budget allow.

%h3 Upcoming releases

%h4 v1.1 Performance and stability improvements
%dl
  %dt Concurrent picture creation
  %dd Improve the speed of bulk picture creation by splitting it into concurrent background tasks.
  %dt Handle downloading document
  %dd When a document is opened via iCloud before it is fully downloaded, display a progress meter that indicates download progress.
  %dt Handle empty document state
  %dd Investigate whether the app can be put into a state where no document is opened. If so, handle it gracefully.
  %dt Handle conflict document state
  %dd If two users have saved conflicting versions of a Pick-a-Pic document, display an interface for conflict resolution.
  %dt Improve state restoration
  %dd
    Define more
    %a{ href: "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/foundation/nsuseractivity", target: "_blank" } NSUserActivity
    \ objects so that app state can be restored in greater detail.
  %dt Reduce cache memory footprint
  %dd
    Move cached data from RAM to disk by using
    %a{ href: "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/foundation/urlcache", target: "_blank" } URLCache
    \ instead of
    %a{ href: "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/foundation/nscache", target: "_blank" } NSCache
    \ when possible.

%h4 v1.2: Features for power users
%p
  Our goal is to add features that increase the utility of Pick-a-Pic for professionals.
  We want Pick-a-Pic to be an app that BCBAs and therapists can design treatment programs around.
%dl
  %dt Bulk actions
  %dd Enable multiple pictures to be tagged or deleted at one time.
  %dt Bulk import
  %dd Allow multiple photos or files to be imported.
  %dt Tag on import
  %dd Allow tags to be selected that will be applied to all pictures as they are imported.
  %dt Duplicate book
  %dd Allow books to be copied, including to other Pick-a-Pic files.
  %dt Duplicate page or book
  %dd Allow pages to be copied, including to other books.
  %dt Import export book
  %dd Allow books to be exported and then imported into other Pick-a-Pic documents.
  %dt Import / export photo library
  %dd Allow the photo library to be exported and then imported into other Pick-a-Pic documents.

%h4 v1.3: iPadOS integrations and conventions
%p We want to continue adding the small details that make an app feel truly iPad-like.
%dl
  %dt Live document thumbnail
  %dd
    Implement
    %a{ href: "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/quicklookthumbnailing/qlthumbnailprovider", target: "_blank" } QLThumbnailProvider 
    \ to make Pick-a-Pic document file thumbnails display the cover of one of their books.
  %dt Keyboard shortcuts
  %dd Create keyboard shortcuts for common app actions, such as importing, renaming, deleting, or even scrolling through pages.
  %dt Add app to share sheets
  %dd
    Implement
    %a{ href: "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/social/slcomposeserviceviewcontroller", target: "_blank" } SLComposeServiceViewController
    \ to allow images to be imported as pictures through the system share sheet.
  %dt Rename document while in app
  %dd Allow the currently opened document to be renamed without exiting to the file picker.